    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "March\nTwenty-first,\n19 2 7.\nCalifornia State Highway Commission,\nState Building,\nSan Francisco.\nGentlemen:\nAttention Col. John H. Skeggs\nThe City and County of San Francisco has leased from\nthe 1il1s Estate a tract of land East of the Bay Shore Highway,\nopposite Domita Park, in San Mateo County, to be used as an\nair port.\nThe lease runs for three years with an option for\nrenewal for two additional years.\nThere 1s also a possibility\nthat this site will be selected as a permanent air port site.\nWe have made arrangements with the City of San Bruno for\na fresh water supply, and it will be necessary in order to make\na connection with their water system to cross the Bay Shore\nHighway, as per the accompanying map.\nWe would like to secure from your Commission the right\nor privilege to maintain this water pipe in the location as\nshown on the accompanying blue print.\nWe intend to advertise\nfor bids for the laying of this water pipe on Wednesday of this\nweek and on the following Wednesday we will let the contract,\nso we would appreciate your early consideration and action in\nthis matter.\nVery truly yours,\nRIGHT OF WAY AGENT.\nJJP:KH"
